MeshSDR container image: third-party notices
=============================================

MeshSDR is free software under the GNU Affero General Public License,
version 3 or later (/usr/share/doc/meshsdr/LICENSE). The meshsdr binary
links the components below; the image also ships the external programs
listed further down. Versions are pinned in .infra/docker/Dockerfile.

Corresponding sources
---------------------

The corresponding sources of the GPL and LGPL components bundled in this
image (csdr, owrx_connector, csdr-skimmer and the Debian source packages
of FFTW, rtl-sdr, libusb, libsamplerate, WSJT-X, JS8Call, Dire Wolf,
multimon-ng and rtl_433, at the exact versions installed) are
published with every release as the OCI image tagged `<version>-sources`
next to this image (same repository), under /sources. That image also
holds the source of MeshSDR itself (/sources/meshsdr-src.tar.gz).

Written offer: the complete corresponding source of MeshSDR, at the
version of this image, is available from
https://github.com/yohang/mesh-sdr (the git tag of the image version), and
on request to the publisher of this image for at least three years after
this version was last distributed. The running hub links to it from its
About page.

Native components built from source
-----------------------------------

csdr / libcsdr++ 0.18.41 (https://github.com/luarvique/csdr, tag 0.18.41)
  Linked into meshsdr (cgo, internal/dsp/csdr) and used by the connectors.
  Mixed licence, per file: GPL-3.0-or-later (framework, FFT, AGC, AM demod,
  ...) and BSD-3-Clause (FIR, FM demod, shift, deemphasis, window, log
  power, ...). Texts: /usr/share/doc/csdr/.
  Copyright (c) 2021-2026 Jakob Ketterl, Marat Fayzullin and contributors;
  Copyright (c) 2014-2015 Andras Retzler, HA7ILM.

owrx_connector 0.6.5 (https://github.com/luarvique/owrx_connector, tag 0.6.5)
  rtl_connector, rtl_tcp_connector and libowrx-connector, run by the node as
  separate processes. GPL-3.0-or-later. Text: /usr/share/doc/owrx-connector/.
  Copyright (c) 2019-2026 Jakob Ketterl, Marat Fayzullin and contributors.

csdr-skimmer 1.12 (https://github.com/luarvique/csdr-skimmer, tag 1.12)
  csdr-cwskimmer and csdr-rttyskimmer, CW and RTTY decoders run by the node
  as separate processes.
  GPL-3.0-or-later. Text: /usr/share/doc/csdr-skimmer/.
  Copyright (c) Marat Fayzullin.

JS8 frame parser (internal/radio/infra/decoder/js8.go)
  A Go port of js8py (https://github.com/jketterl/js8py, Jakob Ketterl,
  GPL-3.0) and of the JS8Call 2.2.0 varicode, with the JS8Call JSC word
  list (jsc_map.cpp, embedded in meshsdr). GPL-3.0-or-later.
  Copyright (c) 2018 Jordan Sherer, KN4CRD; Copyright (c) Jakob Ketterl.

